  "description": "Preview release targeting .NET 10.\n\n          MySQL/MariaDB is currently not supported in this version due to missing EF Core provider support.\n          If you require MySQL, please use version 9.x.          \n          \n          Minimal EfCore.Boost multi-project solution template with Model, Migrate, Api, and Test projects, designed to provide a clean, production-oriented starting point.\n          Includes a solution file and 4 projects.",
